OL,3,GNEWSACrossCountry cancels trains due to
OL,4,Adriver shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of CrossCountry rail services
OL,7,Fhave been cancelled on Sunday due to a
OL,8,Fshortage of train drivers.
OL,10,FServices heading out of Birmingham to
OL,11,FReading, Newcastle, Nottingham will no
OL,12,Flonger run, as well as services into
OL,13,Fthe city from Nottingham, Newcastle,
OL,14,FPaignton, Bournemouth, Nottingham,
OL,15,FManchester Piccadilly and Bristol
OL,16,FTemple Meads.
OL,18,FCancellations have also been made on
OL,19,Fsome of the operator's trains from
OL,20,FAberdeen, Cardiff Central, York,
OL,21,FSheffield, Glasgow Central, Dundee, and
OL,22,FPlymouth.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
